## Analyzing Text with Functions

### Counting Words

Words are separated by spaces. Count the spaces, then add 1:

```xiom
fn count_words(text: Str) -> Int {
  let len = string.str_len(text);
  if len == 0 {
    return 0;
  }
  var spaces = 0;
  var i = 0;
  while i < len {
    if text[i] == ' ' {
      spaces = spaces + 1;
    }
    i = i + 1;
  }
  return spaces + 1;
}
```

